<%= @proposal.proposed_by&.full_name || "A deleted user" %> proposes to <%= @proposal.description %> (<%= @proposal.public_id %>).

Reason: <%= @proposal.reason %>

<% if @proposal.key_holder_change? -%>
Every board member at the time of the proposal must approve a key holder change. The change applies after the last approval.
<% else -%>
One board member who did not make the proposal must approve it.
<% end -%>
The proposal expires on <%= @proposal.expires_at.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") %>.

<%= @url %>
